    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re made of paper. You\u2019re extremely vulnerable, and Nature is ruthless. Through the art of origami, you will learn to fold into many useful shapes to overcome challenges \u2014 but only if you find a model to copy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torn Apart is a 2.5D side-scroller where you can transform by mimicking objects from the environment, and gain new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A poetic adventure where the extraordinary blends into the ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838050/extras/09ff97b71ba41221fc90441acfc1f963.poster.avif?t=1751550786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838050/extras/09ff97b71ba41221fc90441acfc1f963.webm?t=1751550786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838050/extras/09ff97b71ba41221fc90441acfc1f963.mp4?t=1751550786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re made of paper. You\u2019re extremely vulnerable, and Nature is ruthless. Through the art of origami, you will learn to fold into many useful shapes to overcome challenges \u2014 but only if you find a model to copy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torn Apart is a 2.5D side-scroller where you can transform by mimicking objects from the environment, and gain new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A poetic adventure where the extraordinary blends into the ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838050/extras/09ff97b71ba41221fc90441acfc1f963.poster.avif?t=1751550786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838050/extras/09ff97b71ba41221fc90441acfc1f963.webm?t=1751550786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838050/extras/09ff97b71ba41221fc90441acfc1f963.mp4?t=1751550786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
